{"2626770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yellowcake", "steam_appid": 2626770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight your way through a post-war nuclear world by scavenging supplies, building your rocket, and taking on bosses! Explore a procedurally generated open world and find items to help you escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SCAVENGE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each biome and scavenge materials. Biomes have unique structures for you to forage. Look for villages for extra loot and traders to expand your stash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CRAFT</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your materials to upgrade your gear, or craft helpful potions to help you survive the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FIGHT</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome has it's own threats and bosses to take down. Defeat each biome one by one, gaining strength to take on stronger challenges.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight your way through a post-war nuclear world by scavenging supplies, building your rocket, and taking on bosses! Explore a procedurally generated open world and find items to help you escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SCAVENGE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each biome and scavenge materials. Biomes have unique structures for you to forage. Look for villages for extra loot and traders to expand your stash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CRAFT</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your materials to upgrade your gear, or craft helpful potions to help you survive the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FIGHT</strong></u></